---
layout: base.njk
title: "Now"
description: "What Harisankar Sivankutty is currently working on, learning, and reading."
permalink: /now/
---

{% block head %}
<link rel="alternate" type="application/atom+xml" title="{{ site.title }}" href="{{ site.url }}/feed.xml" />
<style>
  .now-page { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding-top: 70px; }

  .now-header {
    padding: clamp(48px, 7vh, 80px) var(--pad-x) clamp(36px, 5vh, 56px);
    max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .now-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 18px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  }
  .now-eyebrow::before {
    content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 18px; height: 1px; background: var(--accent);
  }
  .now-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 72px); line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--fg);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .now-updated {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--fg-dim); letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .now-blurb {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-top: 20px; max-width: 540px;
  }

  .now-body {
    max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px var(--pad-x) 96px;
  }

  .now-section { margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .now-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .now-section-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--fg-dim); margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  }
  .now-section-label::after {
    content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border);
  }

  .now-items { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .now-item {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: var(--bg-elevated, #F0EEE6);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .now-item-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .now-item-desc {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .now-back {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--fg-muted); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    padding: 24px var(--pad-x) 0;
    max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .now-back:hover { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<div class="now-page">

  <div class="now-header">
    <div class="now-eyebrow">Present tense</div>
    <h1 class="now-title">Now</h1>
    <p class="now-updated">Last updated · June 2026</p>
    <p class="now-blurb">
      A snapshot of what I'm currently focused on — inspired by
      <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">Derek Sivers' /now page</a> idea.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="now-body">

    <div class="now-section">
      <div class="now-section-label">Building</div>
      <ul class="now-items">
        <li class="now-item">
          <div class="now-item-title">AI engineering patterns for enterprise clients</div>
          <div class="now-item-desc">Working on production RAG systems and agentic workflows at Thoughtworks — bridging the gap between demo-quality and something a team can actually trust in prod.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="now-item">
          <div class="now-item-title">This writing space</div>
          <div class="now-item-desc">Building out the blog and getting into a rhythm of writing things down — mostly to sharpen thinking, secondarily to share it.</div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="now-section">
      <div class="now-section-label">Learning</div>
      <ul class="now-items">
        <li class="now-item">
          <div class="now-item-title">LLM evaluation and observability</div>
          <div class="now-item-desc">Going deep on evaluation frameworks (RAGAS, DeepEval) and what it actually takes to measure quality in production GenAI systems — not just vibe-testing.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="now-item">
          <div class="now-item-title">Multi-agent orchestration</div>
          <div class="now-item-desc">Watching the agent framework landscape evolve — LangGraph, CrewAI, and what the patterns look like when you need determinism and auditability at scale.</div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="now-section">
      <div class="now-section-label">Reading</div>
      <ul class="now-items">
        <li class="now-item">
          <div class="now-item-title">An Elegant Puzzle — Will Larson</div>
          <div class="now-item-desc">Engineering management through a systems lens. The chapters on managing organizational debt feel directly applicable to long-running data platform engagements.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="now-item">
          <div class="now-item-title">Martin Fowler's bliki + recent data mesh thinking</div>
          <div class="now-item-desc">Still the most reliable signal in a noisy landscape for software architecture thinking.</div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="now-section">
      <div class="now-section-label">Interested in</div>
      <ul class="now-items">
        <li class="now-item">
          <div class="now-item-title">Data quality as a product capability</div>
          <div class="now-item-desc">The shift from "quality checks" to observable, trustworthy data that teams actually rely on to make decisions.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="now-item">
          <div class="now-item-title">The convergence of data engineering and AI engineering</div>
          <div class="now-item-desc">The pipeline patterns, governance challenges, and platform thinking that are starting to merge as LLMs move into production data stacks.</div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>

  <a href="/" class="now-back">← Writing</a>

</div>
{% endblock %}
